WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.434 --> 00:00:02.701
-Thank you very much.
Thank you for watching.

00:00:02.701 --> 00:00:04.701
Welcome, welcome, welcome
to "The Tonight Show."

00:00:04.701 --> 00:00:05.868
You're here!

00:00:05.868 --> 00:00:07.701
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:07.701 --> 00:00:09.133
"The Tonight Show."

00:00:09.133 --> 00:00:11.901
Guys, it was such a beautiful
spring day here in New York.

00:00:11.901 --> 00:00:13.701
Wasn't it great? All over.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:13.701 --> 00:00:15.067
All over the city,

00:00:15.067 --> 00:00:16.701
tulips, daffodils,

00:00:16.701 --> 00:00:18.701
police barricades were blooming.

00:00:18.701 --> 00:00:20.701
[ Laughter ]

00:00:20.701 --> 00:00:23.100
That's right. Today, ahead
of his scheduled arraignment,

00:00:23.100 --> 00:00:26.334
former President Trump
flew from Florida to New York

00:00:26.334 --> 00:00:28.200
and landed at LaGuardia Airport.

00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:29.467
Yep, he was smart.

00:00:29.467 --> 00:00:30.834
Nothing helps you
ease into prison

00:00:30.834 --> 00:00:33.000
like spending time
at LaGuardia.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:34.701
[ Laughter ]

00:00:34.701 --> 00:00:36.868
Yeah, Trump flew from Florida
to New York,

00:00:36.868 --> 00:00:39.033
where he'll soon be arrested.

00:00:39.033 --> 00:00:41.367
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:47.367
He's basically doing
a reverse spring break,

00:00:47.367 --> 00:00:49.334
if you think about it.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:49.334 --> 00:00:51.334
Florida, New York, then...

00:00:51.334 --> 00:00:52.501
Of course, all the news outlets

00:00:52.501 --> 00:00:54.567
were covering
Trump's every move.

00:00:54.567 --> 00:00:56.934
Even the Domino's Pizza Tracker
was following him.

00:00:56.934 --> 00:00:59.601
[ Laughter ]

00:00:59.601 --> 00:01:01.234
Then, at his motorcade --

00:01:01.234 --> 00:01:02.901
as his motorcade
left Mar-a-Lago,

00:01:02.901 --> 00:01:05.567
Trump was greeted by some of his
supporters out in the street.

00:01:05.567 --> 00:01:07.234
Here they are.
Take a look at this.

00:01:07.234 --> 00:01:08.400
Yeah.

00:01:08.400 --> 00:01:09.701
[ Laughter ]

00:01:09.701 --> 00:01:12.200
I saw more people
supporting O.J. than that.

00:01:12.200 --> 00:01:13.200
[ Laughter ]

00:01:13.200 --> 00:01:14.701
"A.C., give us a honk-honk!"

00:01:14.701 --> 00:01:16.100
[ Laughter ]

00:01:16.100 --> 00:01:19.267
Meanwhile, Fox News released
a video of Trump supporters

00:01:19.267 --> 00:01:20.601
waiting for him
at the airport.

00:01:20.601 --> 00:01:22.167
And I think it looked
a little different than

00:01:22.167 --> 00:01:24.033
everyone else on Fox News.
Take a look at this.

00:01:24.033 --> 00:01:26.133
-Former president Trump
expected to land

00:01:26.133 --> 00:01:28.534
in New York any moment now.

00:01:28.534 --> 00:01:30.033
There is the live shot

00:01:30.033 --> 00:01:31.701
in New York City...
-Interesting.

00:01:31.701 --> 00:01:33.267
-...as they wait
for his arrival.

00:01:33.267 --> 00:01:36.434
-I just find that interesting.
A little different.

00:01:36.434 --> 00:01:39.334
Yep, Trump was then driven
from LaGuardia to Trump Tower,

00:01:39.334 --> 00:01:41.133
where he's spending the night.

00:01:41.133 --> 00:01:43.534
Meanwhile, back at Mar-a-Lago,
every staffer was like...

00:01:43.534 --> 00:01:45.634
[ "Old Time Rock &amp; Roll" plays ]

00:01:45.634 --> 00:01:48.634
Yeah!
Like, let's get the party going.

00:01:48.634 --> 00:01:49.701
Well, get this.

00:01:49.701 --> 00:01:51.634
Congresswoman
Marjorie Taylor Greene

00:01:51.634 --> 00:01:54.234
announced that tomorrow
she's coming to New York City

00:01:54.234 --> 00:01:55.734
for a peaceful protest

00:01:55.734 --> 00:01:57.868
of Trump's indictment.

00:01:57.868 --> 00:01:59.868
Peaceful, but insane.

00:01:59.868 --> 00:02:01.000
[ Laughter ]

00:02:01.000 --> 00:02:02.200
Speaking of
Marjorie Taylor Greene,

00:02:02.200 --> 00:02:04.067
last night,
she was on "60 Minutes,"

00:02:04.067 --> 00:02:05.968
and here's how
the interview started.

00:02:05.968 --> 00:02:09.501
-We looked up some words
that have been said about you.

00:02:09.501 --> 00:02:10.667
-[ Laughing ] Okay.

00:02:10.667 --> 00:02:11.734
-"Crazy."

00:02:11.734 --> 00:02:13.734
"Q clown."

00:02:13.734 --> 00:02:16.901
"Looney tune."
"Unhinged."

00:02:16.901 --> 00:02:19.234
"Moron."

00:02:19.234 --> 00:02:21.267
Pretty ugly stuff.

00:02:21.267 --> 00:02:22.934
[ Laughter ]

00:02:22.934 --> 00:02:24.934
[ Laughs ]

00:02:24.934 --> 00:02:26.300
-By the 20th insult,

00:02:26.300 --> 00:02:29.300
Marjorie Taylor Greene
was like, "Point made, Lesley!"

00:02:29.300 --> 00:02:31.234
[ Laughter ]

00:02:31.234 --> 00:02:32.400
And this is real --

00:02:32.400 --> 00:02:34.467
Marjorie Taylor Greene's
interview on "60 Minutes"

00:02:34.467 --> 00:02:37.634
was watched
by 6.66 million people.

00:02:37.634 --> 00:02:39.767
[ Audience murmurs ]
-Ohh.

00:02:39.767 --> 00:02:41.934
-And the devil was like,
"Don't associate me with this.

00:02:41.934 --> 00:02:43.767
Alright? Hey!"

00:02:43.767 --> 00:02:45.767
Switching gears,
I saw that Netflix announced

00:02:45.767 --> 00:02:47.667
that they're gonna start
releasing fewer

00:02:47.667 --> 00:02:50.167
but better movies.

00:02:50.167 --> 00:02:53.000
And every actor who's ever done
a Netflix movie was like,

00:02:53.000 --> 00:02:54.467
"Um, rude."

00:02:54.467 --> 00:02:56.133
[ Laughter ]

00:02:56.133 --> 00:02:58.868
Oh, this is wild -- I read
that 50 years ago today,

00:02:58.868 --> 00:03:01.067
the first cell phone call
was made.

00:03:01.067 --> 00:03:02.234
[ Audience oohs ]

00:03:02.234 --> 00:03:04.167
It was exciting at first,
and then two minutes in,

00:03:04.167 --> 00:03:06.133
they were like,
"Well, I should let you go."

00:03:06.133 --> 00:03:07.767
[ Laughter ]

00:03:07.767 --> 00:03:10.033
Finally, guys, you ever see
a photo in the news

00:03:10.033 --> 00:03:11.901
